        "heading": "<p>There is an actual store behind this website.</p>",
        "subtext": "<p>We operate a physical storefront in Coronado, California. The bottles listed on this site are bottles we hold — not inventory sitting in a third-party warehouse, and not a catalog we forward to someone else to fulfill.</p><p>That means when you call with a question about a bottle, you are talking to someone who can walk over and look at it. Every order is packed by hand and ships nationally via UPS, with an adult signature required at delivery.</p>",
