            "title": "Fair pricing on hard-to-find bottles",
            "text": "<p>Allocated does not mean overpriced. When a rare release comes in, it goes up at fair retail the same day — no markup games, no forced bundles, no premium for the privilege of being told it is rare.</p>"
          }
        },
        "value_2": {
          "type": "value",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Real inventory, honestly listed",
            "text": "<p>If it is listed on the site, we have it and we can get it to you. When something sells out we take it down rather than leaving it up at an inflated price to see who bites.</p>"
          }
        },
        "value_3": {
          "type": "value",
          "settings": {
            "title": "A relationship, not a transaction",
            "text": "<p>Questions about a bottle, a gift, or a special order? We are a phone call or a text away, and we answer. Most of our repeat customers started with a question before they ever placed an order.</p>"
